    "https://www.neumann.edu/deposit": {
      "title": "ENROLLMENT DEPOSIT",
      "description": "Enrollment Deposit | Neumann University ENROLLMENT DEPOSIT Skip to main content × ABOUT US ACADEMICS ADMISSIONS Visit Us Transfer Admissions Admitted? Enroll Now CONTINUING EDUCATION STUDENT LIFE FINANCIAL ASSISTANCE ADVANCEMENT Alumni & Arts ATHLETICS MISSION & MINISTRY MyNU Portal MAPS & DIRECTIONS NEWS CONTACT US MENU APPLY GIVE CHALLENGE Home > Deposit May 1: Priority Deposit Deadline for First Year Students Entering Fall 2026 How to submit your enrollment Deposit Step 1 Log into your Neumann Application portal and cl ick on your current application. Step 2 Submit the Reply to Offer of Admission form, located on the Next Steps tab. Step 3 Once you ACCEPT your offer of admission, you will be prompted to pay a secure deposit online. You may use a credit card or authorize an e-check payment to pay your deposit amount. *Please note that e-checks may take up to 5 business days to process. Step 4 You will receive a confirmation that your deposit has been received. Step 5 Refer back to your application portal for next steps in your enrollment! Related Links Office of the President Letter From the President History & Mission Human Resources News/Publications Fast Facts Conferencing/Facilities Rental Consumer Information & Accreditations Finance & Administration Campus Safety Institutional Research & Planning Institutional Review Board Guest Speakers QUICK LINKS About Us Academic Programs Accent Magazine Admissions Alumni & Friends Apply Now Athletics Book Store Campus Ministry Campus Safety Career & Personal Development Catalog Center for Global Engagement Conferencing and Facilities Diversity, Equity, & Inclusion Fast facts Financial Assistance Giving to Neumann Guest Speakers Human Resources Incident Reporting ITR Help Desk Library Mission and Ministry MyNU Portal NeuPress News/Publications NIFS Parents ROTC Student Health Services Student Life Study Abroad Sustainability at NU Job Opportunities Visit Us Column 1 (Hidden Name) About Us Academic Programs Accent Magazine Admissions Advancement Alumni & Friends Apply Now Book Store Business Office Campus Ministry Campus Safety Column 2 (Hidden Name) Career & Professional Development Catalog Center for Global Engagement Conferencing and Facilities Core Experience Faculty Fast Facts Financial Assistance Giving to Neumann Guest Speakers Human Resources Incident Reporting Column 3 (Hidden Name) International Student Support Services ITR Help Desk Library Live Stream #GradLife Podcast The Master It Series Mission and Ministry MyNU Portal NeuPress News/Publications NIFS Parents Column 4 (Hidden Name) Registrar RISES Values ROTC Student Health Services Student Life Student Success Center Study Abroad Sustainability at NU Job Opportunities Visit Us One Neumann Drive Aston, PA 19014-1298 Phone: 610-459-0905 Privacy Policy Neumann University participates in the State Authorization Reciprocity Agreements. Neumann University © 2026. All Rights Reserved."
