    "https://www.neumann.edu/career-development": {
      "title": "Center for Career and Professional Development",
      "description": "Center for Career and Professional Development | Neumann University Skip to main content × ABOUT US ACADEMICS ADMISSIONS Visit Us Transfer Admissions Admitted? Enroll Now CONTINUING EDUCATION STUDENT LIFE FINANCIAL ASSISTANCE ADVANCEMENT Alumni & Arts ATHLETICS MISSION & MINISTRY MyNU Portal MAPS & DIRECTIONS NEWS CONTACT US MENU APPLY GIVE CHALLENGE The John C. Ford Student Success Center Center for Career and Professional Development Our Center provides comprehensive resources to support your professional development at all stages of your education. Our staff members will work with you in every major and every year of your study. STUDENTS/ALUMNI EMPLOYERS FACULTY/STAFF PARENTS/FAMILY Events Calendar EMPLOYER SPOTLIGHT Happy Noises At Happy Noises LLC, we support and empower autistic and all neurodiverse adults across Southeastern, Pennsylvania. We are currently hiring PT/FT Direct Support Professionals, PT Speech Pathologists & PT Occupational Therapists. We offer competitive pay and PTO/IBX Insurance to full-time employees Office Operations Phone: 610-358-4595 Email: cpd@neumann.edu Bachmann (Lower Level), Suite 19 Hours : Monday – Friday 9 a.m. to 5 p.m. Drop-in Hours : Mondays-Fridays 1-3 p.m. 15-min in-person chat with staff. LinkedIn headshots on Wednesdays 1-3 p.m. Book Appointment (Handshake) Request a program Request Data CAREER READINESS Success in your future career requires a strong academic foundation along with key professional skills. The NACE Career Readiness Competencies , developed by the National Association of Colleges and Employers, outline eight essential skills that employers across industries look for in new graduates. LEARN MORE Current Students: \"Log in\" with your MYNU credentials. Alumni: \"Sign Up\" with any email address (top right of log in page) APPOINTMENTS: Go to \"CAREER CENTER\" in your account! Videos: Getting started on Handshake Job/internship search on Handshake Building your profile Articles: 5 steps to success for your first 5 days on Handshake Completing your profile Search for jobs or internships Fall Internship Approval Deadline: August 21 To submit a fall internship for approval, use the Fall 2026 Internship Approval Request . Focus2 is an on-line career system that utilizes assessments to provide information to help you learn more about yourself and identify occupations and majors that may be a good fit for you. LEARN MORE Center for Career and Professional Development Meet the Staff BRAG A BIT QUICK LINKS Column 1 (Hidden Name) About Us Academic Programs Accent Magazine Admissions Advancement Alumni & Friends Apply Now Book Store Business Office Campus Ministry Campus Safety Column 2 (Hidden Name) Career & Professional Development Catalog Center for Global Engagement Conferencing and Facilities Core Experience Faculty Fast Facts Financial Assistance Giving to Neumann Guest Speakers Human Resources Incident Reporting Column 3 (Hidden Name) International Student Support Services ITR Help Desk Library Live Stream #GradLife Podcast The Master It Series Mission and Ministry MyNU Portal NeuPress News/Publications NIFS Parents Column 4 (Hidden Name) Registrar RISES Values ROTC Student Health Services Student Life Student Success Center Study Abroad Sustainability at NU Job Opportunities Visit Us One Neumann Drive Aston, PA 19014-1298 Phone: 610-459-0905 Privacy Policy Neumann University © 2026. All Rights Reserved."
